        "original_id": "d391c413-e2a5-5bee-afe8-a59097de3291",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Todd Phillips, Scot Armstrong, Breckin Meyer, Seann William Scott, Paulo Costanzo, DJ Qualls, Avery Kidd Waddell\n- Works: Road Trip, Old School, Starsky & Hutch, The Hangover Trilogy, Due Date, War Dogs, In Too Deep, The New Guy, Law & Order, Without a Trace, Angel\n- Roles: director, writer, actor\n\nFacts:\n- In 2000, Todd Phillips co-wrote and directed the American comedy film \"Road Trip.\"\n- \"Road Trip\" was written by Scot Armstrong and Todd Phillips.\n- \"Road Trip\" stars Breckin Meyer, Seann William Scott, Paulo Costanzo, and DJ Qualls as four college friends on an 1800-mile trip to recover an illicit tape mistakenly mailed to a girlfriend.\n- Todd Phillips is best known for writing and directing \"Road Trip\" (2000), \"Old School\" (2003), \"Starsky & Hutch\" (2004), \"The Hangover Trilogy\" (2009, 2011, 2013), \"Due Date\" (2010), and \"War Dogs\" (2016).\n- Avery Kidd Waddell is an American director, writer, and actor.\n- Avery Kidd Waddell appeared in the films \"In Too Deep,\" \"Road Trip,\" and \"The New Guy.\"\n- Avery Kidd Waddell guest-starred on \"Law & Order,\" \"Without a Trace,\" and \"Angel.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "b5e39188-4843-5b62-bc39-9818ea9f6988",
        "text": "Page: Todd Phillips. Sentence: He is best known for writing and directing \"Road Trip\" (2000), \"Old School\" (2003), \"Starsky & Hutch\" (2004), \"The Hangover Trilogy\" (2009, 2011, and 2013), \"Due Date\" (2010) and \"War Dogs\" (2016).\nPage: Road Trip (film). Sentence: Road Trip is a 2000 American comedy film directed by Todd Phillips and written by Scot Armstrong and Phillips.\nPage: Road Trip (film). Sentence: The film stars Breckin Meyer, Seann William Scott, Paulo Costanzo, and DJ Qualls as four college friends who embark on an 1800-mile road trip to retrieve an illicit tape mistakenly mailed to a girlfriend.\nPage: Avery Waddell. Sentence: Avery Kidd Waddell is an American director, writer, and actor who's played in many movies like \"In Too Deep\", \"Road Trip\", and \"The New Guy\" and has had guest starred on shows like \"Law & Order\", \"Without a Trace\", and \"Angel\".",
